262e7f70 [gemini-3.7-flash] #• `$80` (`128`): Repeat is enabled for all keys (every alphanumeric key held down
262e7f70 [gemini-3.7-flash] #will auto-repeat).
262e7f70 [gemini-3.7-flash] #• `$40` (`64`): Repeat is completely disabled for all keys.
262e7f70 [gemini-3.7-flash] #
262e7f70 [gemini-3.7-flash] #• (Note: In BASIC, users commonly enable repeat for all keys with `POKE 650, 128` or restore
262e7f70 [gemini-3.7-flash] #default behavior with `POKE 650, 0`.)*
262e7f70 [gemini-3.7-flash] #
